","poem":1},{"text":"ኢታታ አቻ መን።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ፆኖይ ጎዳሳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ጎዳዉ፥ ኔኒ ነ አሳ አንጃ። ሳላህ","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"ማዝሙረይ የፀትያ ዎደ አዝማቸስነ ፓይዶስ ግዶን ጎዳ ቦንቾስ ካኤትያ ሙዙቃ ካሰ። ሽን ቃላ ብርሸይ ኤረተና።","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gof_etw/PSA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}